24:16.610 --> 24:19.710
I'm even more beautiful than the real thing!

24:19.710 --> 24:22.690
I'm a perfect match for Towa-chan!

24:22.690 --> 24:25.140
My name is Towa!

24:25.140 --> 24:27.890
Believe me! I'm the real one, for sure!

24:27.890 --> 24:31.570
It's me! I'm the real Towa-chan!

24:32.790 --> 24:34.570
Hey, it's Towa Amane.

24:40.080 --> 24:43.540
Please don't use my face without permission.
